      "_grow_mask_note": "ComfyUI's own default is 6, which leaves a visible ring around the mask on a 1000px-ish image: RealVisXL is not an inpainting checkpoint, so it refills the blanked region with a slightly different colour balance. 32 was measured to reduce that markedly. Higher values blend better but regenerate more of what you kept, which is why the slider goes to 64."
    },
